                    "text": "Save = getslonamelist If 0 = Save As If > 0 then ask current preset and overwrite. Save As = getslotnamelist If 0 = Add slot 1 ( snapshot of the patch in order to save something) If>0 then ask then ask current preset and overwrite + ask where to save As ( name + path ) Read = load preset = then getslotnamelist If 0 = nothing If > 1 = then ask last used slot/pattern = then load last used ... Add = getslotnamelist + 1 = then Add Clear = getslotnamelist If 0 = nothing If > 1 then getcurrentpattern then clear current or if nocurrent patern selected = then decrement"
